  "en": {
   "headline": "Sensitivity check (IMERG): the difference (Bangladesh − West Bengal (India)) changed by −1.8 mm per decade (95% range −9.8 mm to +6.6 mm). It is shown beside MERRA-2 and gets no verdict.",
